mindmap
  root((HTML5))
    Semantic Structure
      header - introductory content
      nav - navigation links
      main - dominant content
      section - thematic grouping
      article - self-contained content
      aside - tangential content
      footer - footer info
    Forms and Input
      "Input types: text, email, url"
      "Validation: required, pattern, min"
      fieldset + legend for grouping
      novalidate for custom validation
    Multimedia
      audio with multiple sources
      video with poster and tracks
      canvas for bitmap drawing
      track for captions and subtitles
    Accessibility ARIA WCAG
      "Perceivable, Operable, Understandable"
      ARIA roles, states, properties
      Alt text on all images
      Landmark roles from semantics
    SEO Meta Tags
      title, description, keywords
      "Open Graph: og:title, og:image"
      "Twitter Cards: summary_large_image"
      Canonical URL, robots
    Browser APIs
      "Web Storage: localStorage and sessionStorage"
      Geolocation API
      Drag and Drop API
